## Title: DoesItDie (TBC & Classic Era)
## Notes: Tracks your DoTs and marks the damage they still have left on your target's health bar, with a kill icon on the portrait when they'll finish it off. TBC Anniversary and Classic Era port of the WoW Forever addon. /did
